'''Naraka prison''' was an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[prison]] on the [[planet]] [[Naraka]]. The [[pirate]] [[Hondo Ohnaka]] and his cellmate, [[Terba]], were both held there before the [[Spectres]] undertook a [[Rescue of Hondo Ohnaka|mission]] to rescue the former.<ref name="Steps" />

